Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.KaryClone
Column name: RefNo Type: INT64 Description: reference number, eg '14620'
Column name: CaseNo Type: STRING Description: case number, usually between 1 and 10, but can also be an arbitrary string, eg 'A11'
Column name: InvNo Type: INT64 Description: investigation number, between 1 and 9
Column name: CloneNo Type: INT64 Description: clone number, between 1 and 58
Column name: ChromoMin Type: INT64 Description: most common values are between '42' and '51', but minimum value is '0' and maximum is '409'
Column name: ChromoMax Type: INT64 Description: most common values are between '43' and '52', but minimum value is '0' and maximum is '409'
Column name: CloneShort Type: STRING Description: shorter, sometimes truncated clone description, eg '45,X,-Y' or '46,Xy,t(8;21)(q22;q22)'
Column name: CloneLong Type: STRING Description: usually blank, but if the clone description is very long, that string will be stored here
Column name: CloneLength Type: INT64 Description: length of clone description string -- usually between 8 and 24 characters, but can be up to 2199 characters
Column name: Sole Type: STRING Description: T/F flag indicating whether or not this is the sole abnormality
